# Optional frontend override.
# By default, Vite's dev server proxies /api to the FastAPI backend at
# http://127.0.0.1:8000, so you normally do not need this file.
#
# Set it only when you are NOT using the Vite proxy (e.g. calling an API
# deployed elsewhere). Copy this file to frontend/.env and uncomment:
#
# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000